# Copy style

User-facing copy must not use:

1. **Em dashes** (`—`) or **en dashes** (`–`). Use a period, comma, colon, or rewrite the sentence. Regular hyphens in compound words (talk-to-me, 15-minute) are fine.
2. **The word "but"** in any capitalization. Split into two sentences or rephrase. Do not swap in a synonym that keeps the same contrast-hinge habit if a cleaner rewrite exists.

This applies to UI labels, marketing copy, notes, offers, titles, alt text, RSS, and chat replies about this repo. Developer comments can follow the same rule when easy.
